   230	### <span class="mark">FAQs (7 questions)</span>
   231	
   232	<span class="mark">**1. I am not sure I want surgery. Can I still come
   233	and see you?  **
   234	Absolutely. Uncertainty is actually a good reason to reach out. Many of
   235	our patients come to their first appointment not knowing whether surgery
