   239	take as long as you need before making any decision.</span>
   240	
   241	<span class="mark">**2. What is the difference between medical
   242	management and surgery?  **
   243	Medical weight management uses non-surgical tools such as GLP-1
   244	medications and structured dietary programs to support weight loss and
   245	improve related health conditions. Surgery physically changes the size
   246	or function of your stomach to produce – based on clinical averages –
   247	greater, more sustained results for most patients. Both are legitimate
   248	pathways; some patients use medical management first before
   249	transitioning to surgery. The right starting point depends on your
   250	health history, goals, and personal preference, and is something we work
   251	through with you.</span>
