   149	- Reader: a Perth adult at the beginning of their research, possibly BMI 27–35, may not know the word "bariatric", may feel shame or exhaustion — the page must normalise the conversation before it can sell it
   150	- This page should do the most to establish "obesity as a medical condition, not a willpower failure" — that framing is the emotional foundation the rest of the site is built on
   151	- Do not over-index on surgery; the medical management pathway is genuinely presented as an equal option on this page

