content-reviews/weight-loss-surgery-perth.md-79-   h. **Outcome-certainty claim**
content-reviews/weight-loss-surgery-perth.md-80-
content-reviews/weight-loss-surgery-perth.md-81-   > Weight loss surgery and medical weight management can both produce significant, lasting results, but no pathway is entirely passive. Long-term success depends on the habits and support built around treatment, and some weight regain over time *is* possible if those aren't maintained. Our team stays involved well beyond your initial treatment, adjusting your care as your needs change. The goal is sustainable results over the long term, not just weight loss in the short term.
content-reviews/weight-loss-surgery-perth.md-82-
content-reviews/weight-loss-surgery-perth.md-83-   > Weight loss surgery and medical weight management may help some people, but results vary and weight regain can occur. Follow-up focuses on long-term weight management, with the plan adjusted as your needs change.
--
content-reviews/weight-loss-surgery-perth.md-190-> The cost of weight loss treatment in Perth depends on the pathway: medical management, dietitian-led programs and surgery all have different fee structures, and surgical costs also vary by procedure, private health cover, hospital excess and anaesthetist fees. Some patients explore approved payment or funding pathways, but these should be discussed separately and should not influence whether treatment is clinically appropriate.
